# Media Hub operations

See also the global rule `dev-environment.mdc` for ports, Neon hosts, and cross-project paths.

## Production (Render)

- URL: https://media-hub-05s0.onrender.com/
- Build/start/health: defined in `render.yaml`
- API + frontend deploy together via `artifacts/api-server/build.mjs` and `src/lib/static-frontend.ts`

## Local secrets

`artifacts/api-server/.env` — dev Neon only. Production `DATABASE_URL` is set in Render dashboard only.

## Key commands

```powershell
corepack pnpm --filter @workspace/api-server run build
corepack pnpm --filter @workspace/api-spec run codegen
corepack pnpm --filter @workspace/db run push
corepack pnpm --filter @workspace/scripts run export-data
corepack pnpm --filter @workspace/scripts run import-data
```
